#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md
msgid "imports, optimize, open statements, cleanup"
msgstr "Import, 最適化, open 文, クリーンアップ"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:7
msgid "Optimize Imports"
msgstr "Import の最適化"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:9
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{bdg-success}`Native`"
msgstr "{bdg-success}`Native`"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:11
msgid "Goal"
msgstr "目標"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:13
msgid ""
"Clean up redundant and duplicate `open` statements in your ReScript files"
" to keep imports tidy and reduce noise."
msgstr ""
"ReScript ファイル内の冗長・重複した `open` 文を整理して、Import をきれいに保ち"
"ノイズを減らします。"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:15
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "手順"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:17
msgid "1. Run Optimize Imports"
msgstr "1. Optimize Imports を実行する"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:19
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"With a `.res` file open, press {kbd}`Ctrl+Alt+O` ({kbd}`Cmd+Alt+O` on "
"macOS), or use **Code > Optimize Imports** from the menu."
msgstr ""
"`.res` ファイルを開いた状態で、{kbd}`Ctrl+Alt+O`（macOS では {kbd}`Cmd+Alt+O`）を"
"押すか、メニューから **Code > Optimize Imports** を使用します。"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:21
msgid "The plugin scans the file and automatically removes:"
msgstr "プラグインがファイルをスキャンし、以下を自動的に削除します:"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:23
msgid "**Duplicate opens** --- When the same module is opened more than once"
msgstr "**重複した open** --- 同じモジュールが複数回 open されている場合"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md
msgid "Before"
msgstr "変更前"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md
msgid "After"
msgstr "変更後"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:47
msgid "2. Review inspection warnings"
msgstr "2. インスペクション警告を確認する"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:49
msgid ""
"The **Duplicate Open Detection** inspection highlights redundant opens in"
" real time as you edit. Look for yellow warning underlines on `open` "
"statements."
msgstr ""
"**Duplicate Open Detection** インスペクションは、編集中に冗長な open をリアルタイムで"
"ハイライトします。`open` 文に黄色い警告の下線が表示されます。"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:51
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hover over the warning to see the details, or press {kbd}`Alt+Enter` for "
"a quick fix to remove the duplicate."
msgstr ""
"警告にカーソルを合わせると詳細が表示されます。{kbd}`Alt+Enter` を押すと、重複を削除する"
" Quick Fix が表示されます。"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:53
msgid "3. Configure auto-optimization (optional)"
msgstr "3. 自動最適化を設定する（任意）"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:55
msgid "To run import optimization automatically on save or reformat:"
msgstr "保存時やリフォーマット時に Import 最適化を自動実行するには:"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:57
msgid "Open **Settings > Editor > Auto Import**"
msgstr "**Settings > Editor > Auto Import** を開く"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:58
msgid "Under the **ReScript** section, configure the auto-import behavior"
msgstr "**ReScript** セクションで Auto Import の動作を設定する"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:59
msgid "Click **Apply**"
msgstr "**Apply** をクリックする"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:61
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You can also run import optimization as part of **Code > Reformat Code** "
"({kbd}`Ctrl+Alt+L` / {kbd}`Cmd+Alt+L`) by checking the **Optimize "
"imports** option in the reformat dialog."
msgstr ""
"リフォーマットダイアログで **Optimize imports** オプションにチェックを入れることで、"
"**Code > Reformat Code**（{kbd}`Ctrl+Alt+L` / {kbd}`Cmd+Alt+L`）の一部として "
"Import 最適化を実行することもできます。"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:63
msgid "4. Project-wide optimization"
msgstr "4. プロジェクト全体の最適化"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:65
msgid "To optimize imports across the entire project:"
msgstr "プロジェクト全体で Import を最適化するには:"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:67
msgid "Select the project root (or a directory) in the **Project** panel"
msgstr "**Project** パネルでプロジェクトルート（またはディレクトリ）を選択する"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:68
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Use **Code > Optimize Imports** ({kbd}`Ctrl+Alt+O` / {kbd}`Cmd+Alt+O`)"
msgstr "**Code > Optimize Imports**（{kbd}`Ctrl+Alt+O` / {kbd}`Cmd+Alt+O`）を使用する"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:69
msgid "Review the preview of changes and click **Run**"
msgstr "変更のプレビューを確認し、**Run** をクリックする"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:71
msgid "Expected Result"
msgstr "期待される結果"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:73
msgid ""
"All `.res` files in the selected scope have clean, non-redundant `open` "
"statements."
msgstr ""
"選択されたスコープ内のすべての `.res` ファイルで、冗長でないきれいな `open` 文に"
"なります。"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:75
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "ヒント"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:77
msgid ""
"Combine import optimization with **Reformat Code** for a one-step cleanup"
" workflow"
msgstr ""
"Import 最適化と **Reformat Code** を組み合わせると、ワンステップでクリーンアップできます"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:78
msgid ""
"The inspection can be configured in **Settings > Editor > Inspections > "
"ReScript > Duplicate open statement**"
msgstr ""
"インスペクションは **Settings > Editor > Inspections > ReScript > Duplicate open "
"statement** で設定できます"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:79
msgid ""
"Use `// noinspection RescriptDuplicateOpen` to suppress the warning for "
"intentional duplicates"
msgstr ""
"意図的な重複に対して警告を抑制するには `// noinspection RescriptDuplicateOpen` を"
"使用します"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:81
msgid "Related Features"
msgstr "関連機能"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:83
msgid ""
"[Code Analysis](../features/code-analysis.md) --- Duplicate open "
"detection and other inspections"
msgstr ""
"[Code Analysis](../features/code-analysis.md) --- 重複 open の検出とその他のインスペクション"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:84
msgid ""
"[Find Dead Code](find-dead-code.md) --- Remove unused code alongside "
"unused imports"
msgstr ""
"[Find Dead Code](find-dead-code.md) --- 未使用の Import と合わせて未使用コードを削除"

#: ../../user/recipes/optimize-imports.md:85
msgid "[Code Editing](../features/code-editing.md) --- Formatting and code style"
msgstr "[Code Editing](../features/code-editing.md) --- フォーマットとコードスタイル"
